<div class=3D"cell normal" data-type=3D"normal">
<div class=3D"innerCell">
<p>Where each folder is named after the classification label of the images =
it contains.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class=3D"columnLayout fixed-width" data-layout=3D"fixed-width">
<div class=3D"cell normal" data-type=3D"normal">
<div class=3D"innerCell">
<span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper conflu=
