data-media-id=3D"49ab44c0-d85c-4622-b96a-1ffbcd591fed" data-media-type=3D"f=
ile" height=3D"230"></span>
<h2 id=3D"TraininganImageClassifierwithCreateML-Trainingourmodel">Training =
our model</h2>
<p>To train the model, we=E2=80=99ll use <strong>CreateML</strong>, Apple=
=E2=80=99s tool designed to simplify this process.</p>
<p>Simply launch CreateML, select <strong>=E2=80=9CNew Document=E2=80=9D</s=
trong>, and choose the <strong>Image Classification</strong> template.</p><=
span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper conflue=
nce-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image image-cen=
ter" alt=3D"ti1.png" width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"87399c7e12cb36ef=
367f8e57a8fab9212bdc1e6a356628b2f2760f7b56821fe7" data-image-src=3D"https:/=
/developeracademy.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/1208877328/ti1.pn=
g?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1750692278811&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp=
;api=3Dv2" data-height=3D"888" data-width=3D"1162" data-unresolved-comment-=
count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"1208877355" data-linked-resource-ver=
sion=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-de=
fault-alias=3D"ti1.png" data-base-url=3D"https://developeracademy.atlassian=
.net/wiki" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-reso=
urce-container-id=3D"1208877328" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"=
1" data-media-id=3D"a57a993b-985e-4ccf-869c-7056b2212aa3" data-media-type=
=3D"file" height=3D"357"></span>
<p>Next, select your training and testing folders:</p><span class=3D"conflu=
ence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-=
size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image image-center" alt=3D"ti2.png"=
 width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"8776e13ea522d56ec82864394268afa5dec6=
0dc5da02c0b799fabe5095e1ce45" data-image-src=3D"https://developeracademy.at=
lassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/1208877328/ti2.png?version=3D1&amp;mo=
dificationDate=3D1750692278811&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-heig=
ht=3D"740" data-width=3D"1559" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-lin=
ked-resource-id=3D"1208877352" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-link=
ed-resource-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"ti2.p=
ng" data-base-url=3D"https://developeracademy.atlassian.net/wiki" data-link=
ed-resource-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D=
"1208877328" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"1" data-media-id=3D"=
0910d73b-4c57-400a-8b6a-85dc7b7b9ef2" data-media-type=3D"file" height=3D"22=
2"></span>
<p>In the <strong>Training Parameters</strong> section, after some testing =
for this example, we achieved good results with the following setup:</p><sp=
an class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluenc=
e-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image image-cente=
r" alt=3D"ti3.png" width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"8aac0d7c983a5e7675=
67e50c660c1d547025be4dc5d05726fd161fcf19ab0c84" data-image-src=3D"https://d=
